{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05188","headline":"出塞 · 张柬之","name":"出塞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"侠客重恩光，骢马饰金装。\n瞥闻传羽檄，驰突救边荒。\n歙野山川动，嚣天旌斾扬。\n吴钩明似月，楚劒利如霜。\n电断冲胡塞，风飞出洛阳。\n转战磨笄俗，横行戴斗乡。\n手擒郅支长，面缚谷蠡王。\n将军占太白，小妇怨流黄。\n騕褭青丝骑，娉婷红粉妆。\n三春莺度曲，八月鴈成行。\n谁堪坐愁思，罗袖拂空牀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张柬之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05188.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05188","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}